case ok-hello-addon-self
desc ungrouped hello: the roster request as an add-on whisper to self, echoed back ungated, answered with VERBS and TRANSPORT none
module yes
send addon-self roster
frame addon WHISPER_SELF TBM roster
recv addon WHISPER TBM roster
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ROSTER_BEGIN|1
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ROSTER|101|Alpha|1|online|0|Elwynn Forest|Warrior
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ROSTER_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:ALTBOTS|
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:CC_ASSIGN_BEGIN|0
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:CC_ASSIGN_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:CLAIMED_BEGIN|0
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:CLAIMED_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:BOTSTATE_BEGIN|0
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:BOTSTATE_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:VERSION|v0.1.0-forever
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:PROTO|1|1
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:LATEST|-|-
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:VERBS_BEGIN|3
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:VERBS|action,action:follow,roster
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:VERBS_END
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:CAPS|behavior,inventory
recv addon WHISPER TBM TBM:TRANSPORT|none
expect hello.complete true
expect hello.transport none
expect hello.proto 1
expect hello.min_addon 1
expect hello.version v0.1.0-forever
expect hello.caps behavior,inventory
expect hello.has_verbs true
expect hello.verbs action,action:follow,roster
expect hello.check ok
expect roster.count 1
expect roster.0.class_name Warrior
expect unknown.count 0
expect ignored.count 1
expect problems.count 0
